OL,3,GNEWSADamage to Grade II* listed
OL,4,Abuilding 'disheartening'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCriminal damage to the roof of an empty
OL,7,F236-year-old Grade II* listed building
OL,8,Fwas "disheartening", a heritage trust
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FHertfordshire Police said sections of
OL,12,Fthe lead roof had been stolen from The
OL,13,FBury, a 1790 building in Hemel
OL,14,FHempstead, Hertfordshire, last weekend.
OL,16,FWork to make the property watertight is
OL,17,Fexpected to happen next week.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
