OL,3,GNEWSADamage to Grade II* listed
OL,4,Abuilding 'disheartening'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDacorum Heritage Trust, a preservation
OL,7,Fcharity which said in July it was
OL,8,Fhoping to transform the council-owned
OL,9,Fbuilding into a heritage centre, said
OL,10,Fit was saddened by the damage but was
OL,11,Fpleased that steps were being taken "to
OL,12,Fmake it safe and prevent further
OL,13,Fdamage".
